  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrapper for Google's `osv-scanner` (2.x). Cross-ecosystem SCA: reads a CycloneDX SBOM or per-language lockfiles, queries OSV.dev (npm, PyPI, Cargo, Go, Maven, NuGet, Packagist, Pub, …), emits SARIF or CycloneDX 1.5 with inline VEX. Pinned to 2.x — the 1→2 boundary restructured the CLI around subcommands and deprecated the original --sbom-only invocation form.",
